* {{I|Sinus Infection}}: The boogers with Holy Light effect do not spawn beams of light.
* {{I|Spirit Sword}}: Hitting an enemy with Spirit Sword has a chance to spawn a damaging beam of light.
* {{I|Tear Detonator}}: Having Holy Light effect on a tear does not affect the burst tears from it. They can have Holy Light effect applied depending on Isaac's Luck.
* {{T|Teardrop Charm}}: Activation rate is affected.
* {{I|Technology}}: {{Dlc|nr}}Overrides Holy Light.
