* {{I|Technology Zero}}: Electricity connecting tears with Holy Light tears will not gain Holy Light effect.
* {{I|Technology 2}}: Tears will occasionally have Holy Light effect.
** {{Dlc|r}} The lasers can create beams of light.
* {{I|Tech X}}: {{Dlc|nr}}Overrides Holy Light.
** {{Dlc|r}} The lasers can create beams of light.
* {{I|Trisagion}}: {{Dlc|nr}}Overrides Holy Light.
** {{Dlc|r}} Blasts can apply Holy Light, with a light beam being generated on each damage tick, dealing Isaac's tear damage per beam (three times Trisagion's damage).

